   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO102 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 11 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12815 · Decision 437/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 25/04/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO102 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>11 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12815 · QĐ 437/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 25/04/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Discuss the theory of supply and demand</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Recognize the influences of market equilibrium and disequilibrium</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Describe the theory of supply and demand in real-life scenarios</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Identify the tools and strategies to understand supply and demand applications</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Understand consumer and producer behavior</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Understand macroeconomic variables</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Analyze the influences of aggregate demand and aggregate supply</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Understand how the government policies affect individuals, firms, and society.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Understand how the fiscal and monetary policies affect macroeconomy.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Show self-reliance when working independently and collaboratively.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>CLO11</strong></td><td>Demonstrate ethical awareness and reflection in business context.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12815\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12815</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12815\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12815</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
